{"title":"Career Roadmap: Nutrition Educator","role":"Nutrition Educator","summary":"Career Domain: Agriculture, Food & Life Sciences · Qualification Pathway: B.Sc – Community Science · Target Career: Nutrition Educator","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Hons) Agriculture and Allied","Course":"Community Science"},"about":[{"label":"About this roadmap","text":"This roadmap was drafted with AI assistance from OneGrasp's related roadmaps and is awaiting expert review. Check fees, dates, eligibility and exam patterns on the official websites before you rely on them."},{"label":"Important","text":"Becoming a Registered Dietitian needs a PG and the Indian Dietetic Association's process."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Nutrition Educator teaches families, schools and communities how to eat well - balanced diets, child and maternal nutrition, anaemia prevention - often through government and NGO programmes."},{"type":"h","text":"What a Nutrition Educator does"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Run nutrition sessions and demonstrations"},{"text":"Assess diets and growth of children and mothers"},{"text":"Create simple education materials in local languages"},{"text":"Support POSHAN Abhiyaan, ICDS and school programmes"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Where they work:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NGOs and public-health programmes"},{"text":"ICDS / Anganwadi programmes"},{"text":"Schools and colleges"},{"text":"Food and health companies"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career stage","Typical role"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry-level"},{"text":"Nutrition Educator"}],[{"text":"Early career"},{"text":"Programme Officer"}],[{"text":"Mid-level"},{"text":"Programme Manager"}],[{"text":"Senior"},{"text":"State Nutrition Lead"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Programme Director"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year-by-Year Learning Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"